  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Civil Society oversight of inclusiveness, conduct and perception of Nigeria&apos;s Elections - Yar&apos;Adua Foundation is a component of Deepening Democracy in Nigeria 2 (DDIN2) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xa3;1,199,279. It works in the following sector(s): Elections, Public sector policy and administrative management, Democratic participation and civil society, Women&apos;s rights organisations and movements, and government institutions, Human rights, Media and free flow of information.</narrative>
  </description>
